    "long_instructions": "#Step 1: Ask It.\r\n\r\n1. “Plan a fun weekend event for middle school students.”\r\n\r\n2. Then say: “Add details.”\r\n\r\n#Step 2: Stress Test It.\r\n\r\n3. Add specific context.\r\n\r\n\t- “We have a small budget.”\r\n\r\n\t- “We live in a big city.”\r\n\r\n\t- “We can’t travel.”\r\n\r\n\t- “We need adult supervision.”\r\n\r\n**What did the AI assume at first?**\r\n\r\n**What changed when you gave more information?**",
